            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Richard Stallman</strong><br>\nRichard Stallman, born in 1953, is an American software developer who founded the GNU Project. He grew up in New York City and developed an interest in computing at a young age. Stallman attended Harvard University, where he was known for his skills in programming. During his time at Harvard, he also worked at the MIT Artificial Intelligence Laboratory, where he was a part of the hacker community.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The GNU Project and Free Software</strong><br>\nIn 1983, Stallman launched the GNU Project to create a free operating system. The GNU's General Public License (GPL) was designed to guarantee users the freedom to share and change free software. Stallman's commitment to free software stems from his belief in collaboration and the idea that software should not have restrictions on use, modification, or distribution.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Stallman's Philosophy</strong><br>\nStallman's philosophy emphasizes the importance of software freedom rather than open-source code, which focuses on the practical benefits of software sharing. He argues that users of software should have the liberty to control what their software does and share it with others. This philosophy laid the groundwork for the free software movement.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
